<Base
  title="Privacy Policy: Book and Gin Society"
  description="How the Book and Gin Society handles the personal information collected on this site."
>
  <section class="page-head"><h1>Privacy</h1></section>
  <article class="prose">
    <p>We collect your email address to send you updates and respond to your enquiries. We also gather anonymised tracking statistics (such as website visits) and email open and click rates to help us improve our content. We keep your information safe and do not share it with third parties except for our secure email service provider. Under the Privacy Act 2020, you have the right to ask for a copy of any personal information we hold about you, and to ask for it to be corrected. To do so, contact us at hello@bookandginsociety.com.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
